/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
/pkg
node_modules/
.DS_Store

# `nomo html` writes its output beside the worksheet it rendered. Scoped to the
# example worksheets rather than `*.html`, which also swallowed web/index.html.
/examples/*.html

# Browser front end
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# The math font, fetched by scripts/fetch-font.sh and verified against the
# hashes in scripts/fonts/. Third-party and not redistributed from here; what
# `web/dist/` ships is a subset built from it. See THIRD-PARTY.md.
web/vendor/

# Third-party, and neither is redistributable from here. `corpora/` is fetched
# on demand by scripts/fetch-corpora.sh and verified against the hashes in
# scripts/corpora/; `reference/` is two codebases to learn from, over a gigabyte
# between them. See THIRD-PARTY.md.
#
# The glob rather than the one name: CORPUS_ROOT can put a corpus anywhere, and
# a fetch into `corpora-2/` was very nearly committed by a `git add -A` because
# only the exact name was ignored. Nothing third-party gets committed, so the
# ignore has to cover the names people actually use.
/corpora*/
/reference*/

# Python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
